    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430480/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1755483678\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430480/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1755483678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaunts Gambit is a multiplayer first person shooter game. Set in an abandoned school left empty because of a rampant virus,\u00a0former students sneak back in fighting over control of the grounds and buildings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Subject to Change)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2v2 TeamMatch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Royale</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FFA</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2V2 TEAMMATCH:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are divided into two teams of two, where they battle  for their team in a singular building. The team with the most kills wins the match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players fight on a shrinking map, scavenging gear and eliminating others. The last player standing wins!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players face waves of zombies, barricading entrances to slow them down. Survive as long as possible against the increasing difficulty!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FFA:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players compete solo in a battle for the highest kill count before the timer runs out. The top scorer wins!</p>",
